WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Catalog & branches”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open the Catalog
From the menu choose the Catalog and review the existing products.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Add products
Add the product data, the price, the image and the required fields, or use import if it is available.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Review the branches
Go to Branches and complete their data, then check that the products and branches were saved correctly.
